        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                "word": "alsmede",
                "pos": "conj",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                        "entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "en ook"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94890b25-d5f3-4567-a4d4-8f45cbfabadc",
                                "sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                                "text": "De koffer hebben ze in het bruin alsmede in het zwart."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "483fc43a-bd17-4131-9672-6fc58b0b8a27",
                                "sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                                "text": "Toen mevrouw Lippman samen met Gumb een reis maakte naar Florida en tijdens die reis overleed, erfde hij alles: het oude gebouw met de woonruimten, de lege winkelpui en het grote souterrain, alsmede een aanzienlijke som geld."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56b9c613-e52c-4b12-905d-044527687069",
                                "sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                                "text": "Nadat hij de roerige zaal tot stilte had gemaand, raapte hij een stapeltje papieren op en begon te lezen: 'Het Hof van Beroep heeft gedaagde Meskini, die aangeklaagd is voor het verloochenen en verzuimen van zijn echtelijke plicht alsmede zijn voogdij, door eiser Zuleikha, op grond van wet zus en zo niét schuldig bevonden.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c04ec976-7092-46a0-b596-71a31ff49d0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                        "source_sense_description": "en ook",
                        "target_lang_word": "so wie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85ef2caa-d0de-43c8-8716-87c51fc1a421",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                        "source_sense_description": "en ook",
                        "target_lang_word": "als auch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6edb9e10-edf6-4f7f-a736-e56739e51e4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                        "source_sense_description": "en ook",
                        "target_lang_word": "as well as",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "as well as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                        "entry_id": "8a9a8e4e-6916-3f6d-b2c4-bb87529bba50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "And, in addition; not forgetting"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec73c1af-0a0f-4fba-9752-9bcbf924a1e2",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "The moon as well as the stars was shining down on them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a09aa6b6-6d62-40bb-9f6e-169e83f174f1",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "She has to sing as well as play the piano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbc8324f-a967-4a1f-acbf-630e881ce5a2",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "Smoking is unhealthy, as well as making you smell bad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c87daa0b-209c-4783-9e12-70d66221206f",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "You borrowed my car but never gave it back. And as well as that, you stole my bike."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "268e99a0-ff2c-4e17-817b-17cd7018e3d8",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "Not unnaturally, “Auntie” took this communication in bad part. Thus outraged, she showed herself to be a bold as well as a furious virago. Next day she found her way to their lodgings and tried to recover her ward by the hair of the head."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba032403-1c3f-4ba8-bf2d-ede6cf861989",
                                                "sense_id": "7aa29291-3f0e-3f8c-8f88-06ec5a80952a",
                                                "text": "Basingstoke-Exeter will test this. From Salisbury westwards, it's largely single-track since British Rail downgraded it in 1967. There's a ten-mile loop between Templecombe and Yeovil, as well as shorter loops at Chard, Axminster and Honiton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24308dea-1ff6-3bb1-8daf-63a4a468e645",
                                        "entry_id": "8a9a8e4e-6916-3f6d-b2c4-bb87529bba50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see as, well."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34d28597-1a7b-43a7-961a-3b197f7b763d",
                                                "sense_id": "24308dea-1ff6-3bb1-8daf-63a4a468e645",
                                                "text": "As well as I recollect, he was about six feet tall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30ec494f-407b-4f97-bf13-939111c24ad9",
                                                "sense_id": "24308dea-1ff6-3bb1-8daf-63a4a468e645",
                                                "text": "She sings as well as she plays the piano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "229b0b8c-3514-4258-8fb9-53d5c16fe238",
                                                "sense_id": "24308dea-1ff6-3bb1-8daf-63a4a468e645",
                                                "text": "[I]n time I got used to every thing, and could do my work as well as my mother."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "as well as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b91417ad-1654-3437-8747-564f9678bdb6",
                                        "entry_id": "1f48ec66-ca90-3084-866f-40b9045ab13c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In addition to; further to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61aada21-5043-4dde-89d6-13c71eeee3c5",
                                                "sense_id": "b91417ad-1654-3437-8747-564f9678bdb6",
                                                "text": "As well as the obvious financial benefits, the merger will allow us some breathing room with regards to R&D."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9da8e9ef-0f61-44f1-983d-7165fd028985",
                        "source_entry_id": "2b649966-3c70-3f24-83d0-6b949b8c9f2a",
                        "source_sense_id": "0b2dc5d7-71ca-3ec3-bc9a-c1e195dc2fcb",
                        "source_sense_description": "en ook",
                        "target_lang_word": "ainsi que",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ainsi que",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f49ef8a2-6e03-3a66-86b9-c3d24c363fed",
                                        "entry_id": "e7b15011-5b93-3427-9cec-8260ea790b1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "De même que."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f4b0e4-8cd6-48d4-b196-cae2344518ae",
                                                "sense_id": "f49ef8a2-6e03-3a66-86b9-c3d24c363fed",
                                                "text": "La lecture de son message ainsi que la présidence de séance échoient à un élu du groupe Le Pen, Édouard Frédéric-Dupont, le vieux comploteur du 6 février 1934."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e636374-5e2c-4d10-b2ae-2abb0bf32d4f",
                                                "sense_id": "f49ef8a2-6e03-3a66-86b9-c3d24c363fed",
                                                "text": "L'hiver 1953-1954 fut particulièrement rude. Des clochards moururent de froid, ainsi qu’un enfant dans une famille mal logée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60a94c51-f91b-444f-a09f-d657784350ed",
                                                "sense_id": "f49ef8a2-6e03-3a66-86b9-c3d24c363fed",
                                                "text": "Pôle d'échanges multimodal de la gare de Poitiers, accueillant une gare routière, un dépose-minute ainsi qu’un tout nouveau parking de 700 places."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2fc9831-4b36-46ea-8b66-46fe6659ce35",
                                                "sense_id": "f49ef8a2-6e03-3a66-86b9-c3d24c363fed",
                                                "text": "Il suivit un moment le flux incessant des badauds, ainsi que le bal des voitures à bras dans lesquelles se prélassaient des militaires désœuvrés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9930b66f-c4db-3be7-aa74-93e7b6f3c8ea",
                                        "entry_id": "e7b15011-5b93-3427-9cec-8260ea790b1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Comme ; à la manière de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32646f39-1a95-44fd-859b-587ffacdf0fc",
                                                "sense_id": "9930b66f-c4db-3be7-aa74-93e7b6f3c8ea",
                                                "text": "Ainsi que je l'ai dit, je m'attache facilement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0304f9c-4c61-4c11-b653-20c5ef5c8616",
                                                "sense_id": "9930b66f-c4db-3be7-aa74-93e7b6f3c8ea",
                                                "text": "Cela s’est passé ainsi que je vous l’ai dit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09dc97ad-8b60-4140-a2ec-26a71ad0d3d9",
                                                "sense_id": "9930b66f-c4db-3be7-aa74-93e7b6f3c8ea",
                                                "text": "Sans doute, en tant qu’écrivain, elle n’est pas inégalable et parfois la mendicité de son style secouru afflige, mais enfin, étant donné qu’elle vit au XVIIᵉ siècle, elle n’est pas au moins une bredouilleuse de pâles oraisons, ainsi que la plupart des prosateurs pieux de ce temps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93238ecc-361e-352c-bf08-571580eb3bb8",
                                        "entry_id": "e7b15011-5b93-3427-9cec-8260ea790b1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "S’emploie pour débuter une comparaison"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cb944db-87f1-44db-8cbf-a7a83fdbc161",
                                                "sense_id": "93238ecc-361e-352c-bf08-571580eb3bb8",
                                                "text": "Ainsi que le soleil dissipe les nuages, ainsi la vérité…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
